 r←Test_POSTRefresh_Pending url;Assert;Authed;live;res;state
⍝ Check a trigger arriving while a refresh runs queues instead of starting a second build
 r←0
 Assert←##.Assert
 Authed←##.MAIN.Authed
 state←#.DCMS.GLOBAL.refresh
 :Trap 0
     'Refresh already running at start of test'Assert ##.WaitRefreshIdle 150
    ⍝ A live stand-in worker: satisfies thread∊⎕TNUMS without doing a build, so the
    ⍝ assertions do not depend on how long a real cache build happens to take.
     live←{⎕DL ⍵}&10
     state.(running thread pending)←1 live 0
     res←('POST'Authed url,'/admin/refresh').Run
     'Expected 202 Accepted'Assert 202=res.HttpStatus
     'Trigger did not queue behind the running refresh'Assert∨/'pending'⍷res.Data.message
     'Pending flag not set'Assert 1=state.pending
     {}('POST'Authed url,'/admin/refresh').Run
     'Pending must remain a single slot'Assert 1=state.pending
     r←1
 :EndTrap
⍝ Teardown: kill the stand-in and release the forged lock
 :If 0≠⎕NC'live'
     {}⎕TKILL live
 :EndIf
 state.(running thread pending)←0 ¯1 0
